<title>CROATIA: SOCCER-CROATIAN FIRST DIVISION RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CROATIAN FIRST DIVISION RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Croatian league first division soccer matches played at the weekend:</p>
<p> Segesta	  0    Mladost 127     0</p>
<p> Zadar	    2    Rijeka	    0</p>
<p> Zagreb	   0    Croatia	   6</p>
<p> Istra	    0    Marsonia	  2</p>
<p> Orijent	  1    Varteks	   0</p>
<p> Sibenik	  2    Osijek	    0</p>
<p> Inker	    0    Hajduk	    2</p>
<p>Postponed: Cibalia v Hrv.Dragovoljac (playing Monday)</p>
